# Keijam design system

`design-system/` is the source of truth. Edit `gen.py`, then run `python3 gen.py && python3 check.py` from that directory. Do not hand-edit `tokens.css` or `tokens.json`. `check.py` must print `FAILS 0`.

- Colors, type, radii, layout, and materials are `--k-*` from `tokens.css` (imported by `src/styles/globals.css`). Do not add `--kj-accent` or a second accent ramp.
- Chrome (panels, toolbars, sidebars, menus, popovers, dialogs, toasts, tooltips) uses fake glass: `data-k-material="thin|regular|thick"` and `src/styles/materials.css`. Canvas and frames stay solid.
- Do not set `backdrop-filter`. `--k-material-*-blur` stays `0px`. Noise is the cached `/brand/noise.png`, not a filter.
- `prefers-reduced-transparency` already maps materials to `--k-material-solid-fallback` in the generated CSS. Do not invent a second fallback.
- Inputs at rest use `var(--k-color-control-border)`. No hardcoded hex, rgb, or hsl in admin or ui CSS modules, and no `var(--token, fallback)`.
- Decisions: `docs/memory/decisions.md`. Spec: `design-system/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.
